---
alwaysApply: false
---

- authority: safety-critical BDD; clarity>DRY; explicitness>cleverness; no explanation unless asked
- scope-: unimplemented features; future behavior
- scope+: incomplete feature|scenario => `@wip`
- trace: follow `traceability-e2e.mdc`
- steps.lang: domain-driven; declarative; present tense; third person; English
- steps.unit: 1 step = 1 action | 1 verifiable outcome
- steps.data: explicit values only when behavior changes
- steps.quotes: identifiers only; `"D-EBPN"` `"EDXW"`
- steps.assert: behavior; not UI
- steps-: trailing punctuation; abstract domain identifiers; technical jargon `API|SQL|CSS`
- feature: user goal
- scenario: specific outcome
- scenario.unit: 1 scenario = 1 behavior
- scenario.len: 5-7 steps; max 10
- scenario.indep: independent
- background.len: <=2 steps
